# MEMBER VISIBILITY (plans/reference/MEMBER_VISIBILITY.md, decided 2026-09-16):
# a `_`-prefixed field or method is private to its type's declaring module and
# to that module's same-directory siblings. `main.yo` reads `Counter._count`,
# declared in `lib/counter.yo` — another directory — so `check` must fail with
# the E0405 diagnostic at the ACCESS site. stdout_keep_match asserts THE error
# rather than merely A failure.
stdout_keep_match=is private to its declaring module
timeout=120
